/span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"corner_protection\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"double_wall_edge_board\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"unboxable_at_site\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"reassembly_required\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"package_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PKG-2-LEGS\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"dims_cm\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"l\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">60</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"w\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">40</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"h\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"gross_weight_kg\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"stackable_layers\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"top_load_limit_kg\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">80</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"reinforcement_grade\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"L1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"ista_basis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1A\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"corner_protection\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"none\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"unboxable_at_site\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"reassembly_required\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"volumetric_weight_kg\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">219.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"chargeable_weight_kg\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">219.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"volume_utilization_ratio\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.31</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>volume_utilization_ratio</code> 是实重与计费重之比，它是监控包装设计是否恶化的核心指标；比率下降说明空隙变多，应当触发包装评审，而不是等到运费账单出来才发现。<code>unboxable_at_site</code> 与 <code>reassembly_required</code> 是给第 3.1 篇（<a href=\"../assembly-install-service/unbox-assembly-install\">开箱、组装与安装作业</a>）的安装工序用的：它决定现场是「整箱拆开」还是「只带配件包进门」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"交接点与责任划分\">交接点与责任划分</h2><p>大件跨境链路有四个典型交接点，每个点都必须产生可举证的记录，否则第 4.2 篇的定责就没有依据：</p>\n<h3 id=\"四道交接点的举证要求\">四道交接点的举证要求</h3><ol>\n<li><strong>工厂/起运仓交接给货代</strong>：记录包件外观、封箱状态、照片。此点之后发生的隐蔽损伤（外箱完好但内部断裂）通常仍归承运方，因为内部损伤是搬运冲击造成的。</li>\n<li><strong>出口报关与装船</strong>：记录是否加固、是否改包装。</li>\n<li><strong>目的港拆箱</strong>：这是<strong>外箱损伤的高发点</strong>。拆箱时若发现外箱破损必须拍照并开箱验货，而不是原样转发到本地仓。</li>\n<li><strong>本地大件仓收货</strong>：最后一个能对上游索赔的窗口。一旦入了本地仓并签收，后续在派送或安装现场发现的损伤，举证责任就转移到本地环节。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"贸易术语与风险转移\">贸易术语与风险转移</h3><p>贸易术语决定了这些交接点里谁承担风险。按 ICC 的 <a href=\"https://iccwbo.org/business-solutions/incoterms-rules/incoterms-2020/\">Incoterms 2020 规则说明</a>，11 条规则里 DAP（Delivered at Place）与 DPU（Delivered at Place Unloaded）的关键差别就在这里：DAP 下卖方在<strong>卸载前</strong>完成交付，买方负责卸货；DPU 下卖方必须<strong>完成卸载</strong>才算交付。大件送装一体场景通常选择延伸到 DAP 甚至门到门，因为大件的卸载本身就需要专业设备（见第 1.2 篇的吊装能力），把它留给客户是不现实的。风险转移点的选择直接决定「货在客户门口卸货时摔了，谁赔」，这是必须在合同与系统字段里同时写死的。</p>\n<h3 id=\"法定赔偿下限\">法定赔偿下限</h3><p>跨境承运人的赔偿责任在美国境内受 Carmack Amendment 约束，<a href=\"https://www.law.cornell.edu/uscode/text/49/14706\">49 U.S.C. § 14706</a> 规定承运人须为「the actual loss or injury to the property」负责，且「Failure to issue a receipt or bill of lading does not affect the liability of a carrier」——也就是说没有提单不构成免责。同一条还规定了承运人不得设定短于 9 个月的索赔期与短于 2 年的诉讼期。对系统的直接含义是：索赔时限字段必须是硬约束，超期即视为放弃，这在数据模型上应当体现为异常单的一个不可逆状态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>大件的国际运输成本由<strong>体积重</strong>主导，包装设计的核心指标是实重与计费重之比，应作为商品档案的常驻字段监控。</li>\n<li>包装强度应分级并可配置，分级基准对齐 ISTA 协议族；进入 LTL 网络的大件必须按零担运输条件加严，重点保护棱角。</li>\n<li>拼柜混装需要「可堆码层数 + 承压上限」两个字段参与排柜计算，不能靠货代临场判断。</li>\n<li>交接点四道，每道都要有可举证的记录；目的港拆箱是外箱损伤的高发窗口，必须开箱验货。</li>\n<li>Incoterms 2020 的 DAP 与 DPU 差别在「谁卸货」，大件场景通常延伸到卖方卸货；承运人赔偿责任受 Carmack Amendment 约束，索赔期与诉讼期的下限是法定不可缩短的。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大件国际运输与包装加固","id":"大件国际运输与包装加固"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"运输方式与体积重口径","id":"运输方式与体积重口径"},{"level":3,"text":"三种方式的取舍","id":"三种方式的取舍"},{"level":3,"text":"拼柜混装规则","id":"拼柜混装规则"},{"level":2,"text":"包装加固的分级","id":"包装加固的分级"},{"level":3,"text":"分级依据与协议族","id":"分级依据与协议族"},{"level":3,"text":"包装档案建模","id":"包装档案建模"},{"level":2,"text":"交接点与责任划分","id":"交接点与责任划分"},{"level":3,"text":"四道交接点的举证要求","id":"四道交接点的举证要求"},{"level":3,"text":"贸易术语与风险转移","id":"贸易术语与风险转移"},{"level":3,"text":"法定赔偿下限","id":"法定赔偿下限"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"大件本地仓与装卸设备","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bulky-goods-whiteglove-delivery/bulky-inbound-local-warehouse/bulky-local-warehouse-handling"}}